---
import { networkTerritories as projections } from '../../data/network-territories'
// Reuse the public geometry and attribution, but inherit the actual site tokens.
// Local, versioned artwork only; never inject data returned by the private API.
const maps = import.meta.glob('../../../public/maps/*.svg', { query: '?raw', import: 'default', eager: true }) as Record<string, string>
const shapes = projections.map(({ id }) => {
  const source = maps[`../../../public/maps/${id}.svg`]
  const group = source?.match(/<g\b[\s\S]*<\/g>/)?.[0]
  if (!group) throw new Error(`Fond de carte absent : ${id}`)
  return { id, markup: group.replace(/fill="#[a-f\d]+"/gi, 'fill="var(--vert-clair)"').replace(/stroke="#[a-f\d]+"/gi, 'stroke="var(--vert)"') }
})
---

<div class="trainer-network" id="trainer-network">
  <p>Les formateurs WISE-UP qui forment les adultes en établissement, toutes promotions confondues.</p>
  <p class="iw-small iw-muted">Localisation par commune ou territoire, jamais à l’adresse personnelle. Les repères proches sont regroupés. Formation suivie et validation sont deux étapes distinctes.</p>
  <noscript><p>Activez JavaScript pour consulter la carte et la liste du réseau.</p></noscript>
  <p data-network-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Chargement du réseau…</p>
  <button type="button" class="iw-button iw-button--plain" data-network-retry hidden>Réessayer</button>
  <div data-network-content hidden>
    <div class="trainer-network__filters">
      <div class="iw-field"><label for="network-year">Année de promotion</label><select id="network-year"><option value="">Toutes les années</option></select></div>
      <div class="iw-field"><label for="network-state">Statut</label><select id="network-state"><option value="">Tous les statuts</option><option value="valide">Formateurs validés</option><option value="formation">En cours de formation</option><option value="validation">Validation en attente</option></select></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="trainer-network__legend" aria-label="Légende de la carte" data-network-legend></ul>
    <div class="trainer-network__views">
      <div>
        <div class="iw-field"><label for="network-territory">Territoire</label><select id="network-territory">{projections.map(p => <option value={p.id}>{p.label}</option>)}</select></div>
        <div class="trainer-network__map" aria-label="Carte des communes du réseau">
          <svg viewBox="180 20 640 600" aria-hidden="true">
            <desc>France : contours administratifs 2026 — Etalab / IGN, Licence Ouverte, etalab-datasets.geo.data.gouv.fr. Belgique : Natural Earth, contour national simplifié 110m, domaine public.</desc>
            {shapes.map(shape => <g data-network-territory={shape.id} style={shape.id === 'metropole' ? undefined : 'display:none'} set:html={shape.markup} />)}
          </svg>
          <div data-network-points></div>
        </div>
        <p class="iw-small iw-muted">Choisissez un point pour voir les formateurs de cette commune. La liste ci-dessous permet aussi de les retrouver sans utiliser la carte.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trainer-network__selection" data-network-selection aria-live="polite">
        <h3>Les formateurs près de chez vous</h3><p>Sélectionnez une commune sur la carte.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <details class="trainer-network__directory">
      <summary>Liste des formateurs et localisations à préciser</summary>
      <ul data-network-list></ul>
    </details>
    <p class="iw-small iw-muted" data-network-updated></p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  import '../../scripts/carte-reseau'
</script>

<style is:global>
  .trainer-network { min-width: 0; }
  .trainer-network p { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .trainer-network__filters { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--s-lie); margin-block: var(--s-lie); }
  .trainer-network__legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6em 1em; list-style: none; padding: 0 !important; margin-block: var(--s-lie); }
  .trainer-network__legend li { display: flex; gap: .4em; align-items: center; margin: 0 !important; font-size: var(--t-note); }
  .trainer-network__swatch { display: inline-block; width: .85em; height: .85em; border: 1px solid var(--vert); background: var(--network-color); border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .trainer-network__swatch--validation { border-radius: 0; transform: rotate(45deg); background: transparent; border: 2px solid var(--orange); }
  .trainer-network__views { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--s-lie); align-items: start; }
  .trainer-network__map { position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 640 / 600; background: var(--papier); margin-block: var(--s-lie); border: 1px solid var(--vert); border-radius: .5rem; }
  .trainer-network__map svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
  .trainer-network__point { position: absolute; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; padding: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; display: grid; place-items: center; cursor: pointer; }
  .trainer-network__point > span { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2px; padding: 3px; min-width: 24px; min-height: 24px; max-width: 44px; background: var(--blanc); border: 2px solid var(--vert); border-radius: 50%; color: var(--noir); font-size: var(--t-note); }
  .trainer-network__point:hover, .trainer-network__point:focus-visible { z-index: 2; }
  .trainer-network__point:focus-visible, .trainer-network__point[aria-pressed='true'] { outline: 3px solid var(--vert); outline-offset: -3px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .trainer-network__selection { background: var(--papier); padding: var(--s-lie); border-radius: .5rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .trainer-network__selection h3 { font-size: var(--t-corps); }
  .trainer-network__selection ul, .trainer-network__directory ul { padding-left: 1.25em; }
  .trainer-network__directory { margin-block: var(--s-lie); }
  .trainer-network__directory summary { cursor: pointer; min-height: 44px; padding-block: .5em; font-weight: 600; }
  .trainer-network__member { overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: var(--t-note); }
  .trainer-network__member strong { display: block; }
  .trainer-network__member span { display: inline-block; margin-right: .4em; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .trainer-network__views, .trainer-network__filters { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
